    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "「HOG 方向梯度直方图」最有意思的地方，是结果本身，还是它重新定义问题的方式？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "纳夫尼特·达拉尔和比尔·特里格斯推广了用于人体检测的方向梯度直方图。该描述子在归一化单元中总结局部边缘方向，使行人检测在深度 CNN 特征占主导之前更加稳健。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-histograms-of-oriented-gradients-for-human-detection"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "图像窗口被划分为单元，每个单元投票边缘方向，归一化块再输入分类器。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-histograms-of-oriented-gradients-for-human-detection"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把 HOG 视为手工视觉描述子的标志性成果。它的长期影响在于单元与块的表示模式在端到端学习特征普及前让稳健目标检测变得实用。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-histograms-of-oriented-gradients-for-human-detection"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "当今天的系统规模越来越大时，「HOG 方向梯度直方图」留下的思路还有哪些价值，又有哪些边界值得重新追问？",
